From: =?UTF-8?q?Rouzbeh=E2=80=A0?= <rqzbeh@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 00:32:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(hosts): admin role gets access to all shared hosts

Admins now see and control every host; non-admins keep owner-only access.

- HostStore.list_all_hosts(): cross-user admin listing
- resolve_host_owner(): is_admin flag waives ownership (runner launch + session-create workspace probe)
- hosts.py routes: admin bypass on list + all single-host operations
- workspace probe threads permission_store through helpers/scheduled paths
- tests: admin bypass, non-admin still 403, list_all_hosts
- designs/admin-host-access.md: future per-user grant + admin UI plan
